F95Jusw&oe=6A1EEEC5"}, {"file_name": "Arterial Line Placement_banner.00_00_10_18.Still003 (1).png", "id": "938665181894060", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_938665185227393_2002801451300649644_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M9mbUHLEOzwQ7kNvwELRvJI&_nc_oc=Adqoz8TQW18gkmXep0D4OXr7QXR2BQ2-rOYBCTmWhaF7XkglLwCutxdi4KDjpbDgIe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7prdr1JMnWD6T_khFoehJLv1cuc2FWpdjdYKTdwZzLTg&oe=6A1EF970"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arterial Line Placement", "keywords": ["Medvr", "VR", "Arterial", "Line", "Placement"], "long_description": "Arterial Line Placement is an immersive VR training experience designed to help medical students and healthcare professionals develop confidence and precision in arterial catheterization.\n\nThrough realistic, step-by-step simulation, users can practice identifying anatomical landmarks, performing needle insertion, and managing the procedure safely. The application provides an interactive learning environment where mistakes can be made without real-world consequences, enabling users to refine their technique and improve decision-making skills.\n\nIdeal for training, revision, or skill reinforcement, this simulation combines visual realism with guided learning to enhance procedural understanding and hands-on readiness in clinical settings.", "short_description": "Master arterial line placement in an immersive VR simulation. Practice accurate catheter insertion, identify anatomical landmarks, and build confidence in a risk-free, interactive environment designed for medical training."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nbme.org/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MedVR Education", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://medvr.education/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags